## 3️⃣ Best‑Practice Checklist (Security‑Sensitive Use)

| ✅ Checklist | Why it matters |
|--------------|----------------|
| **Use a CSPRNG** (cryptographically secure pseudo‑random number generator) | Prevents attackers from predicting future tokens. |
| **Include enough entropy** – at least 128 bits for API keys, 80‑bits for short one‑time codes. | Entropy ≈ `log2(alphabetSize^length)`. Example: 62‑char alphabet + 10 chars → ~59.5 bits. Add more characters or a larger alphabet if you need higher security. |
| **Avoid ambiguous characters** (`0/O`, `l/1`, `I`) when the token will be typed by humans. | Reduces user error. |
| **Don’t reuse seeds** – let the OS provide the seed (e.g., `secrets`, `crypto.randomBytes`). | Predictable seeds break security. |
| **Store hashes, not raw secrets**, when possible (e.g., password storage). | Limits damage if the database leaks. |
| **Set an expiration** for one‑time tokens (e.g., 5 min, 24 h). | Limits the window for replay attacks. |
| **Rate‑limit validation attempts** (e.g., 5 tries per minute). | Thwarts brute‑force guessing. |
| **Consider URL‑safe alphabets** (`A‑Z a‑z 0‑9 - _`) for tokens that appear in URLs. | Prevents encoding issues. |
| **Add a checksum or HMAC** if you need to detect typos (e.g., `abcd‑efgh‑1234‑X9`). | Users can spot a mistyped character. |
| **Document the format** (length, alphabet, grouping) for any downstream system that consumes the token. | Guarantees interoperability. |

---

## 4️⃣ Quick “starter‑kit” for Common Scenarios

| Scenario | Recommended Length | Alphabet | Example Code |
|----------|-------------------|----------|--------------|
| **User password** | 12‑16 (or longer) | Upper + lower + digits + `!@#$%&*` | `secrets.choice(string.ascii_letters + string.digits + "!@#$%&*")` |
| **Email verification code** | 6‑8 | Digits only (`0‑9`) | `''.join(secrets.choice(string.digits) for _ in range(6))` |
| **API key** | 32‑64 (base64‑url) | Binary → Base64‑URL | `base64.urlsafe_b64encode(secrets.token_bytes(24)).decode().rstrip('=')` |
| **Short URL slug** | 7‑9 | URL‑safe (`A‑Z a‑z 0‑9 - _`) | `secrets.choice('ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789-_')` |
| **Game‑style item code** | 4‑6 groups of 4 chars, dash‑separated | Uppercase + digits | `'-'.join(random_string(4, string.ascii_uppercase + string.digits) for _ in range(4))` |
| **Test data placeholder** | Any | Any (even just `string.ascii_lowercase`) | `''.join(random.choice(string.ascii_lowercase) for _ in range(10))` |

